@startuml
!include _style.iuml
hide empty description
skinparam roundCorner 22
skinparam nodesep 90
skinparam ranksep 110
title State Machine Diagram — Reminder (ReminderStatus)

state SCHEDULED
state SENT
state CANCELLED

[*] --> SCHEDULED : new Reminder(...)\n— save() for a new reminder
SCHEDULED --> SENT : markSent() / send()\n— date reached (ReminderJob hourly,\nor dispatchIfDue right after save)
SCHEDULED --> SCHEDULED : reschedule()\n— save() again with\nnew days / channel
SCHEDULED --> CANCELLED : cancel()\n— user removes it
SENT --> SCHEDULED : reschedule()\n— save() again
SENT --> CANCELLED : cancel()\n— user removes it
CANCELLED --> SCHEDULED : reschedule()\n— save() again
CANCELLED --> CANCELLED : cancel()\n— removed again

note bottom of SENT
  send() throws BusinessRuleException
  "This reminder was already sent."
  (state does not change)
end note
note bottom of CANCELLED
  send() throws BusinessRuleException
  "A cancelled reminder cannot be sent."
  isActive() = false (only this state)
end note
@enduml
